  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that may be exposed to or interested in stereotypes about LGBTQ+ individuals in Muslim communities, particularly those who hold or are influenced by Islamophobic or LGBTQ+-discriminatory views. The target audience likely includes individuals who are familiar with or perpetuate harmful generalizations about gay men in the Muslim world, and who may find the hypersexualized stereotype presented in the meme amusing, provocative, or reinforcing of existing prejudices. The visual of the well-dressed man is used to appeal to an audience that associates attractiveness with sexualized traits, thereby amplifying the stereotype. The meme’s intent to spread misinformation and prejudice suggests it targets communities or individuals who are susceptible to or actively promote such harmful narratives.",
